 "case:locations.drawing_room.art.props.7.label": "窗户",
 "case:locations.drawing_room.description": "狭长的客厅，昨晚一家人就在这里等候祝酒。今早炉火重新生了起来；昨晚的白兰地酒杯仍摆在托盘上。",
 "case:locations.drawing_room.hotspots.hs_brandy.label": "白兰地酒杯",
 "case:locations.drawing_room.hotspots.hs_brandy.text": "托盘上有五只白兰地酒杯。丹尼尔把他的威士忌带去了台球室；其余的人都在这里喝过——只是有早有晚。",
 "case:locations.drawing_room.hotspots.hs_mantel.label": "壁炉台座钟",
 "case:locations.drawing_room.hotspots.hs_mantel.text": "壁炉台上一座旅行座钟，走得分秒不差。宅子里的每一座钟，都是莱昂内尔每个星期天亲手校准的。",
 "case:locations.drawing_room.hotspots.hs_scorepad.label": "桥牌桌",
 "case:locations.drawing_room.hotspots.hs_scorepad.text": "牌桌还是他们离开时的样子：两副牌、一个烟灰缸和记分簿。",
 "case:locations.drawing_room.hotspots.hs_sewing.label": "针线篮",
