 "case:timeline.events.tl_bridge.time": "22:00",
 "case:timeline.events.tl_call.teaser": "九点半到十点之间，有人并不在自己声称的地方。",
 "case:timeline.events.tl_call.text": "芬奇开始给哈特利打秘密电话",
 "case:timeline.events.tl_call.time": "21:32",
 "case:timeline.events.tl_daniel.teaser": "十点到十一点之间，有人溜进过书房——却对此只字不提。",
