 "case:timeline.events.tl_kneels.text": "众人围拢时，埃莉诺跪在书桌后面",
 "case:timeline.events.tl_letters.teaser": "九点半到十点之间，有人去过书房。",
 "case:timeline.events.tl_letters.text": "埃莉诺送信给莱昂内尔签字",
